PRECOMPUTED POSTERIOR SAMPLES

The precomputed posterior samples for the three proposed multivariate models are permanently archived on Zenodo:

DOI: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22811959

The following files should be downloaded and placed in the "results" folder before running script-original-data.R as provided:

- multi-2022-nimble-MH-indep-8k-2k-30-WAIC.rds
- multi-2022-nimble-MH-corr-8k-2k-30-WAIC.rds
- multi-2022-nimble-MH-corr-ire-8k-2k-30-WAIC.rds